{
  "id": 544,
  "name": "poke-flute",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "plot-advancement",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/22/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Réveille un Pokémon endormi.  Requis pour réveiller le Ronflex endormi dans le monde ouvert.",
      "short_effect": "À utiliser pour réveiller un Pokémon endormi, incluant Ronflex sur les routes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Wakes up sleeping Pokémon.  Required to wake up sleeping Snorlax on the overworld.",
      "short_effect": "Use to awaken sleeping Pokémon, including Snorlax on roads.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "A sweet-sounding\nflute that awakens\nPOKéMON.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/6/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A flute that is said to instantly\nawaken any POKéMON. It has a\nlovely tone.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "firered-leafgreen",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/7/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ねむっている　ポケモンも\nおもわず　めざめるほど　すばらしい\nねいろを　かなでる　ふえ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "잠자고 있는 포켓몬도\n무심코 잠에서 깨어날 정도로\n멋진 음색을 내는 피리.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une flûte au son si particulier qu’elle permet de\nréveiller les Pokémon les plus profondément\nendormis.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Flöte, die so wundervolle Töne spielen kann,\ndass selbst schlafende Pokémon aufwachen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una de las misteriosas Megapiedras. Permite\nmegaevolucionar a Scizor en combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Flauto dal suono meraviglioso che risveglia\nanche i Pokémon profondamente addormentati.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A flute which can play with such a\nbeautiful tone that even sleeping\nPokémon find themselves roused.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "眠っている　ポケモンも\n思わず　めざめるほど　すばらしい\n音色を　奏でる　ふえ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una de las misteriosas Megapiedras. Permite\nmegaevolucionar a Scizor en combate.",
